  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(0.061 times 0.061 times 0.061+0.031 times 0.031 times 0.031)/(0.061 times 0.061-0.061 times 0.031+0.031 times 0.031) \n\n**Formula Used:**\n\na³ + b³ = (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ **(0.061 times 0.061 times 0.061+0.031 times 0.031 times 0.031)/(0.061 times 0.061-0.061 times 0.031+0.031 times 0.031) **\n\n⇒ **((0.061)³+(0.031)³)/((0.061)² -0.061 times 0.031+(0.031)² ) **\n\n⇒ **((0.061)³+(0.031)³)/((0.061)² -0.061 times 0.031+(0.031)² ) **\n\nUsing identity,\n\n⇒ ((0.061+0.031)((0.061)² -0.061 times 0.031+(0.031)²))/((0.061)² -0.061 times 0.031+(0.031)² ) \n\n⇒ 0.061 + 0.031\n\n⇒ 0.092\n\n**∴ Option 1 is the correct answer.**",
